# ============================================================
# Frigate media disk-cap cleanup - crontab entry
#
# Install on the host (overwrites the whole crontab):
#     crontab scripts/crontab.sample
# or merge into an existing crontab:
#     crontab -e     # paste the line below
#
# The script writes its own log to config/cleanup_media.conf's
# LOG_FILE, so cron output is sent to /dev/null.
#
# Adjust /home/dr/frigate if the host deploy dir is different.
# ============================================================

# Run every 30 minutes
*/30 * * * * /home/dr/frigate/scripts/cleanup_media.sh >> /dev/null 2>&1
